window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-025-ef4566f28b82db3e.json"]={sha256:"ef4566f28b82db3ec4d9d258389bce76a3bc7c099998a2b717283a6b50c5ca09",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-2edf39976eb0ca17","url":"https://quantumai.google/cirq/tutorials/google/identifying_hardware_changes","title":"Identifying Hardware Changes","titleEn":"Identifying Hardware Changes","publisher":"Google Quantum AI","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-025","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-025","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-026","referenceUrls":["https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-experiments/manuals/verification/randomized_benchmarking.html"],"title":"Qiskit 隨機化基準：衰減參數與 Clifford 誤差","titleEn":"Qiskit randomized benchmarking: decay parameter and Clifford error","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付漂移斜率、相位界線與校準／工作時間圖。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver drift slope, phase limits and calibration/work timelines. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Qiskit 隨機化基準：衰減參數與 Clifford 誤差』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付衰減曲線、SPAM／EPC區分及批次穩定性報告。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Qiskit randomized benchmarking: decay parameter and Clifford error', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver decay curves, SPAM/EPC distinctions and a batch-stability report.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：線性漂移Δf=rt在固定門窗τ形成φ=2πrtτ；僅為短時間預測，突跳或隨機漫步需其他模型。 使用教學漂移r=2 kHz/min，校準後t=10 min，τ=1 μs。 以手算或試算表計算名義式2*pi*2000*10*1e-6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以0、2、4 min三個合成頻率點確認斜率；外插10 min前查線性殘差。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：擬合P(m)=Aα^m+B後，單量子位元EPC=(1−α)/2；依賴RB模型，不是每個原生門的錯誤。 使用教學α=0.998，A=0.48，B=0.5；Clifford長度m無單位。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(1-0.998)/2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：生成m=0、100、200的P值再反推α；P(0)=0.98而非1是SPAM參數造成，不應強制改寫。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Linear drift Δf=rt produces φ=2πrtτ in fixed gate window τ; this short-term model excludes jumps and random walks. Use Teaching drift r=2 kHz/min, elapsed t=10 min and τ=1 μs. Evaluate nominal expression 2*pi*2000*10*1e-6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Use synthetic0,2,4 min frequencies to confirm slope; inspect linear residuals before extrapolating to10 min.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: After fitting P(m)=Aα^m+B, single-qubit EPC=(1−α)/2; this RB-model quantity is not every native gate error. Use Teaching α=0.998, A=0.48 and B=0.5; Clifford length m is dimensionless. Evaluate nominal expression (1-0.998)/2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Generate P at m=0,100,200 and recover α; P(0)=0.98 reflects SPAM parameters and should not be forced to1.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-035","referenceUrls":["https://www.ionq.com/resources/best-practices-for-using-ionq-hardware"],"title":"IonQ Raman 控制：失諧與散射代理","titleEn":"IonQ Raman control: detuning and scattering proxy","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付漂移斜率、相位界線與校準／工作時間圖。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver drift slope, phase limits and calibration/work timelines. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『IonQ Raman 控制：失諧與散射代理』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付固定窗與等角度兩種實驗設計，並標出不能直接比較的欄位。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'IonQ Raman control: detuning and scattering proxy', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver fixed-window and equal-angle experiment plans, marking incomparable fields.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：線性漂移Δf=rt在固定門窗τ形成φ=2πrtτ；僅為短時間預測，突跳或隨機漫步需其他模型。 使用教學漂移r=2 kHz/min，校準後t=10 min，τ=1 μs。 以手算或試算表計算名義式2*pi*2000*10*1e-6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以0、2、4 min三個合成頻率點確認斜率；外插10 min前查線性殘差。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：固定單光子驅動時，散射代理Γsc∝1/Δ²；同時Raman耦合亦隨失諧改變，不能只看散射。 使用教學參考Δ0=100 GHz、Γ0=40 s⁻¹，Γsc=Γ0(Δ0/Δ)²；固定觀察窗200 μs。 以手算或試算表計算名義式40*(100/100)**2*200e-6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：核對Γsc單位s⁻¹乘秒得無量綱；若要同旋轉角，另延長門時間並重新積分散射。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Linear drift Δf=rt produces φ=2πrtτ in fixed gate window τ; this short-term model excludes jumps and random walks. Use Teaching drift r=2 kHz/min, elapsed t=10 min and τ=1 μs. Evaluate nominal expression 2*pi*2000*10*1e-6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Use synthetic0,2,4 min frequencies to confirm slope; inspect linear residuals before extrapolating to10 min.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: At fixed single-photon drive, scattering proxy Γsc∝1/Δ²; Raman coupling also changes with detuning, so scattering is not the only metric. Use Teaching reference Δ0=100 GHz, Γ0=40 s⁻¹ and Γsc=Γ0(Δ0/Δ)²; observation window is fixed at200 μs. Evaluate nominal expression 40*(100/100)**2*200e-6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check s⁻¹ times seconds is dimensionless; equal-angle operation requires a separate duration adjustment and new scattering integral.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-9dad25457bdb4a58","url":"https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-experiments/manuals/verification/randomized_benchmarking.html","title":"Randomized Benchmarking","titleEn":"Randomized Benchmarking","publisher":"Qiskit Experiments","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-be4f718fe09216f8","url":"https://www.ionq.com/resources/best-practices-for-using-ionq-hardware","title":"Best Practices for Using IonQ Hardware","titleEn":"Best Practices for Using IonQ Hardware","publisher":"IonQ","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
